r)'><h4 style='color:var(--amber)'>⚠️ Risk / Watch</h4><p>The payment-dialog-stuck &amp; PAX uncertain-result fix (9549) shipped — monitor PAX terminal stability in the field. Two QA-complete PRs (9648, 9581) are queued for the <b>Aug 11 go-live</b>.</p></div><div class='box' style='background:var(--blue-bg);border-left:4px solid var(--blue)'><h4 style='color:var(--blue)'>🎯 Next Period</h4><p>Aug 11 go-live for 9648 &amp; 9581 (dev-led QA done). Void-reason API v5 (9634) continues in development, QA scheduled Aug 17–18.</p></div></div></div><div class='card'><div class='sec-title'>This Week — Delivered</div><div class='feat-group'><div class='gt' style='color:#2563eb'>🛒 Product &amp; Platform Development</div><div class='prrow'><span class='tag'>9623</span>Loyalty app theme &amp; logo refreshed for a cleaner branded customer experience. <span class='meta'>&middot; Pramod Pudale &middot; Merged</span></div><div class='prrow'><span class='tag'>9612</span>Developer-ID logic made dynamic — fewer hard-coded config edge cases. <span class='meta'>&middot; Pramod Pudale &middot; Merged</span></div><div class='prrow'><span class='tag'>9594</span>Utiliko automation-form chatbox — feature development. <span class='meta'>&middot; Pramod Pudale &middot; Merged</span></div></div><div class='feat-group'><div class='gt' style='color:#7c3aed'>💳 SmartPOS Payment Reliability &amp; Coverage</div><div class='prrow'><span class='tag'>9549</span>Fixed the payment-processing dialog getting stuck and handled uncertain PAX terminal result codes — a direct checkout-reliability win. <span class='meta'>&middot; Satishpatel46 &middot; Merged</span></div><div class='prrow'><span class='tag'>9517</span>End-to-end coverage for tip-on-credit-card &amp; gift-card with server PIN. <span class='meta'>&middot; Satishpatel46 &middot; Merged</span></div><div class='prrow'><span class='tag'>9503</span>Promo end-to-end coverage — single &amp; split-check verification. <span class='meta'>&middot; sandeepchorge03 &middot; Merged</span></div></div><div class='feat-group'><div class='gt' style='color:#0c2340'>⚙️ Utiliko QA &amp; Test Automation</div><div class='prrow'><span class='tag'>9579</span>HR-departments manual test cases (#8569). <span class='meta'>&middot; vaishnavi-1005 &middot; Merged</span></div><div class='prrow'><span class='tag'>9577</span>Utilities-users automation suite. <span class='meta'>&middot; Pratik-u25 &middot; Merged</span></div><div class='prrow'><span class='tag'>9591</span>Utilities-users manual test cases. <span class='meta'>&middot; Pratik-u25 &middot; Merged</span></div><div class='prrow'><span class='tag'>9456</span>Employee-termination-reason manual test cases. <span class='meta'>&middot; Pratik-u25 &middot; Merged</span></div></div></div><div class='card'><div class='sec-title'>Issues Closed</div><table><tr><th>#</th><th>Title</th><th>Owner</th><th>Status</th></tr><tr><td>8943</td><td style='color:var(--text)'>Online Ordering UX Improvements — Phase 1 epic (multi-month effort now closed)</td><td>darshan-cn-dev</td><td><span class='st st-done'>Closed</span></td></tr><tr><td>9519</td><td style='color:var(--text)'>Prevent Online-Ordering registration from modifying existing owner-user records</td><td>darshan-cn-dev</td><td><span class='st st-done'>Closed</span></td></tr><tr><td>6409</td><td style='color:var(--text)'>SmartWAIT — Black Iron Burger updates &amp; changes (closed via PR 6478)</td><td>Pramod Pudale</td><td><span class='st st-done'>Closed</span></td></tr></table></div><div class='card'><div class='sec-title'>Release Pipeline</div><div class='pipe' style='background:var(--amber-bg);border:1px solid var(--amber-border);border-left:4px solid var(--amber)'><div class='pt'>🚀 QA Complete — Planned Go-Live Aug 11</div><div class='pi'><span class='tagn'>9648</span> &nbsp;QA complete, awaiting release <span class='st st-rel'>Go-Live Aug 11</span> <span style='color:var(--muted)'>&middot; QA by Satishpatel46</span></div><div class='pi'><span class='tagn'>9581</span> &nbsp;QA complete, awaiting release <span class='st st-rel'>Go-Live Aug 11</span> <span style='color:var(--muted)'>&middot; QA by sandeepchorge03</span></div></div><div class='pipe' style='background:var(--blue-bg);border:1px solid var(--blue-border);border-left:4px solid var(--blue)'><div class='pt'>🔄 In Active Development This Week</div><div class='pi'><span class='tagn'>9634</span> &nbsp;SmartPOS void-reason API v5 (#7381 microservice) <span class='st st-dev'>In Development</span> <span style='color:var(--muted)'>&middot; vaishnavi-1005 &middot; QA scheduled Aug 17–18</span></div></div><div class='note green-note'>Go-live items sourced from this week's QA sign-off; active-dev from the Release Pipeline QA plan. The Dev Pipeline shows no PRs left In Development at week-end — everything else reached <b>Done</b>.</div></div><div class='card'><div class='sec-title'>QA Schedule Snapshot</div><div class='grid2'><div class='box' style='background:var(--green-bg);border-left:4px solid var(--green)'><h4 style='color:var(--green)'>This Week — Done</h4><p>SmartPOS payment e2e (tip CC/GC with server PIN, promo single/split), utilities-users automation &amp; manual suites, HR-departments &amp; employee-termination manual cases. <b>Dev-led QA:</b> Satish QA'd PR 9648, Sandeep QA'd PR 9581 — both cleared for the Aug 11 go-live.</p></div><div class='box' style='background:var(--blue-bg);border-left:4px solid var(--blue)'><h4 style='color:var(--blue)'>Next — Incoming</h4><p>Pratik: quick adhoc pre-release QA on the <b>prod app</b>, 2 hrs Mon (Aug 10) &amp; Tue (Aug 11). Then void-reason API v5 (9634) QA on Aug 17–18.</p></div></div><div class='note' style='background:#f8faff;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text-secondary)'>Pipeline visibility: QA and Dev ran in lockstep — payment fixes shipped with their e2e coverage, and this week's dev-led QA (9648 / 9581) sets up the Aug 11 release.</div></div><div class='card'><div class='sec-title'>Blocker