econdary);margin-bottom:12px'><b>Total PRs</b> per engineer = <b>Delivered</b> + <b>QA Review</b> + Active Dev. <b>Delivered</b> follows the <b>Developer</b> field. <b>QA Review</b> follows the <b>Assignee</b> field (when ≠ developer) and also credits devs who QA'd pre-release PRs this week (Satish → 9648, Sandeep → 9581, go-live Aug 11). &middot; <b>Team avg</b> = total ÷ 5 engineers = <b>2.8</b>.</p><div class='note green-note'>✅ <b>Active Dev Parity Check:</b> the 1 PR in Active Development here (#9634, vaishnavi-1005) matches the pipeline's “In Active Development This Week” widget 1-to-1. No discrepancies.</div><div style='height:14px'></div><div class='bar-row'><div class='bar-name'>Pratik-u25</div><div class='bar-track'><div class='bar-fill' style='width:100%;background:#1a4fa0'>4</div><div style='position:absolute;left:70.0%;top:-4px;bottom:-4px;border-left:2px dotted #94a3b8'></div></div></div><div class='bar-brk'>3 Delivered (#9577, #9591, #9456) · 1 QA Review (#9549)</div><div class='bar-row'><div class='bar-name'>Pramod Pudale</div><div class='bar-track'><div class='bar-fill' style='width:75%;background:#1a4fa0'>3</div><div style='position:absolute;left:70.0%;top:-4px;bottom:-4px;border-left:2px dotted #94a3b8'></div></div></div><div class='bar-brk'>3 Delivered (#9623, #9612, #9594)</div><div class='bar-row'><div class='bar-name'>Satishpatel46</div><div class='bar-track'><div class='bar-fill' style='width:75%;background:#1a4fa0'>3</div><div style='position:absolute;left:70.0%;top:-4px;bottom:-4px;border-left:2px dotted #94a3b8'></div></div></div><div class='bar-brk'>2 Delivered (#9549, #9517) · 1 QA Review (#9648)</div><div class='bar-row'><div class='bar-name'>sandeepchorge03</div><div class='bar-track'><div class='bar-fill' style='width:50%;background:#93c5fd'>2</div><div style='position:absolute;left:70.0%;top:-4px;bottom:-4px;border-left:2px dotted #94a3b8'></div></div></div><div class='bar-brk'>1 Delivered (#9503) · 1 QA Review (#9581)</div><div clas